Package: bioscrna
Type: Package
Title: Single-Cell Gene Expression Analysis Pipeline
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Mengrui", "Zhang",
                  email = "mrzhang@stanford.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for a Bioconductor-based single-cell RNA-seq analysis
    pipeline, including 10X data loading, quality control, normalization,
    dimension reduction, batch correction, clustering, marker detection,
    and common visualization helpers for SingleCellExperiment objects.
